			  "CustomInstructions": "- Net Sales: Use the measure [Net Sales] for queries about \"Net Sales\", \"Revenue\", \"Online Sales\", or \"Digital Channel Revenue\". It represents certified revenue net of returns and discounts for closed financial periods.\n- Financial Periods: Always filter by closed financial periods using dimreportingperiod[IsFinanceClosed] = TRUE or dimreportingperiod[PeriodStatus] = \"Approved\" when answering questions about certified revenue or net sales.\n- Channel: When users ask about \"Online Sales\" or \"Digital Channel Revenue\", filter by dimchannel[ChannelName] = \"Online\"."
			}
